      N\u1ED9</style> cho m\u1ED7i 1 M\xE1u b\u1ECB thi\u1EBFu\nKhi chui xu\u1ED1ng
      \u0111\u1EA5t, n\xF3 nh\u1EADn <style=\"Blue\">C\xE1ch Ly</style> v\xE0 gi\u1EA3m
      M\xE1u T\u1ED1i \u0110a"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 8099901647879405577
  - m_Id: 41288302829051906
    m_Localized: "Sau khi tr\u1ED3i l\xEAn kh\u1ECFi m\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EA5t, sinh
      v\u1EADt n\xE0y ph\xE1t n\u1ED5, g\xE2y 20 s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng l\xEAn m\u1ECDi
      sinh v\u1EADt"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 8099901647879405577
  - m_Id: 41634209193861120
